     "\r\n<font face=\"times new roman\" size=\"3\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:times new roman;font-size:12pt\">Dear all,<br><br>We\r\n are pleased to announce our June course programme, featuring a diverse \r\nset of online trainings across R.<br><br>Course Programme:<br><br>1 - <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course47/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course47/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xaH2UDHbNeTM6lS44ibuj\">Beyond Beginner R: Advancing Your Coding Skills</a> - Online, 1–4 June <br><br>2 -<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rSX13gBVPpIeH1iV8HhsV\"> Introduction to R Shiny</a> - Online, 9–10 June <br><br>3 - <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/r-reproducibility/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/r-reproducibility/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-F_YfRoG8R6WkrW7YQr80\">Reproducibility with R</a> - 8–11 June <br><br>4 - <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course44/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course44/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw18JsKJ3lpMjDxnTYTIyHJR\">Phylogenetic Comparative Methods in R </a>- 15–19 June <br><br>5 - <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/bigphylogenies/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/bigphylogenies/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_PmS8gzJL9GEC_IJD3lz_\">Big Data Phylogeny </a>- 23–26 June <br><br><br>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412629576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cq-Cgz9aNBrnO2L67_e2J\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br></p>\r\n<div>Best regards,</div>\r\n<div>Carlo</div></font>\r\n\r\n"
